OL,3,GNEWSA'Police have failed LGBTQ+ victims
OL,4,Afor years', says Pride
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarwickshire Pride has submitted a
OL,7,Fmajor complaint to Warwickshire Police,
OL,8,Falleging years of failures in the
OL,9,Fforce's handling of hate crimes and
OL,10,Fincidents affecting LGBTQ+ people.
OL,12,FThe complaint brings together around 50
OL,13,Fcases reported by Pride members and the
OL,14,Fwider LGBTQ+ community, including
OL,15,Fhomophobic and transphobic abuse,
OL,16,Fthreats to kill, sexual harassment and
OL,17,Fcriminal damage.
OL,19,FChair Daniel Browne called for "an
OL,20,Fapology and a genuine commitment to
OL,21,Fchange, followed by action".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
