OL,3,GNEWSA'Police have failed LGBTQ+ victims
OL,4,Afor years', says Pride
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarwickshire Police said "hate crime
OL,7,Fand discrimination have no place in our
OL,8,Fcounty" and added the complaint would
OL,9,Fbe "considered through the appropriate
OL,10,Fprocess".
